			"notes": "### Version 1.0.0 Release\n\n_We're so back_\n\n- Completely rewrote all of the backend code to be much more optimized.\n- Rewrote light management system and calculations\n- Rewrote health system\n- Rewrote light armor systems and calculations\n- Added lava and lava bucket as a light source (still deadly though) because it makes sense.\n- Increased block check radius from 2 to 3.\n- Blocks are now checked in a circle instead of a cube.\n- Added \"kinetic_immunity\" for later implementation as an \"ascended\" Sky Kid power.\n- Moved fire(except lava) immunity to it's own power, \"fire_immunity\"."
